n the text, as the wavelength of the laser varies greatly and the monochromaticity is poor. Therefore, this option does not reflect the content of the text.\n\nB) Laser technology has limited potential in the field of science and technology.\n- The text emphasizes the restricted scope of laser technology, especially in communication technology.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
