messages:   35%|###4      | 208/600 [09:36<04:13,  1.55it/s][['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nDirect selling refers to the business mode in which direct selling enterprises recruit sellers to sell products directly to final consumers outside the fixed business place.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options is direct selling?\n# Options:\nA) After selecting salesmen, a dairy manufacturer set up 100 sales points in the city to sell dairy products at a unified price.\nB) A bookstore adopts online sales. after customers place an order, the courier will send the products to the designated place and charge a fee.\nC) Some salesmen recruited by a cosmetics brand set up stalls along the road to distribute product descriptions and sell them to customers at lower prices.\nD) At the beginning of school, the new student xiao he bought five table lamps in the wholesale market, one for his own use, and the other four were sold to his classmates.', "<think>.\nTo determine which option is direct selling, let's analyze each option step by step:.\n\nA) After selecting salesmen, a dairy manufacturer set up 100 sales points in the city to sell dairy products at a unified price.\n- This option involves setting up sales points in the city, which suggests a physical presence and a centralized location for selling products.However, it does not explicitly mention direct selling, as the products are sold at a unified price, which implies a centralized pricing strategy rather than individual pricing based on customer needs.\n\nB) A bookstore adopts online sales.After customers place an order, the courier will send the products to the designated place and charge a fee.\n- This option describes an online sales model where customers place orders and the products are delivered to their designated place.While this is a form of direct selling, it is not the primary focus of the question, as it does not explicitly mention the direct selling aspect.\nThe salesmen recruited by a cosmetics brand avoided setting up stalls along the road to distribute product descriptions and sell them to customers at lower prices.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
