of any film depends on the choice of the producer, and the actors can keep up with the development of the times.\n- This statement implies that the producer's choice of technology does not affect the actors' ability to keep up with the times.While this may be true, it does not directly address the actor's concerns about the future of 3D technology.Therefore, this option does not reduce the actor's worries.The film story can be expressed solely through the director's preferences, without any consideration for the heart and emotion of the actor.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
