hat causes environmental harm or health risks, it could undermine the argument that the agency's actions are beneficial.\n\nB) Has the cheese importation board, over the last several years, reduced its operating costs by eliminating inefficiencies within the agency itself?.\nThis option is relevant because it could provide evidence that the agency is already taking steps to reduce costs.If the agency has already taken measures to reduce costs, it may weaken the argument that the cost outweighs the benefits.The possibility of having merchandise rejected by the cheese importation board does not deter many cheese exporters from shipping substandard cheese to Goronia.It could weaken the argument that the agency's actions are beneficial.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
