an artwork's intrinsic properties are relevant to our aesthetic interactions with it.\n- This option aligns with the context, which states that we should pay attention only to the intrinsic properties of a work of art.Thus, this option follows logically from the given context.\n\nBased on the analysis, the conclusion follows logically if option B is NOT added to the premises. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
