e Each Option:**.\n   - **Option A:** If the proposed area studies department did not duplicate more than 25 percent of the material covered in anthropology, then the new department would not be funded.\n     - This statement implies that if the duplication is less than 25%, the department would be funded.However, the context states that the duplication is more than 25%, so this option does not follow logically.\n   - **Option B:** The proposed area studies department would not duplicate more than 25 percent of the material covered in any existing department other than anthropology.\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is not Option D.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
