ly state that the theory of relativity has developed our understanding of time; it merely presents the theory's perspective on time.The passage clearly indicates that Newton believed time played an active role in shaping the universe, contradicting the idea that he did not consider time to be involved in the composition of the universe. Therefore, the correct answer is not D.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
