In contrast, it offers valuable insights into how financing channels affect the success of startups.Therefore, it strengthens the statement.\n\nB) Venture capitalists are less attentive to changes in the financial needs of startups than other investors.\nThis alternative indicates that venture capitalists may not be as adept at managing the financial difficulties that startups face.If correct, it implies that venture capital funding might not be as beneficial in promoting the progress and prosperity of startups.This would strengthen the argument that financing channels play a crucial role in the successful evolution of a new business compared to other aspects.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
