Jie did not receive a full vote, Li Zilu did not vote for anyone else.\n\nFrom this analysis, we can conclude that:\n\n- Wang Ming did not vote for anyone including Li Zilu.\n- Li Zilu did not vote for anyone including Zhao Jie.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
