evaluate the options:.\n\nA) China's higher education system needs supporting reform to adapt to economic system reform and social development.\nThis option aligns with the context, as it suggests that the higher education system needs reform to better align with the country's economic system reform and social development.\nSince the reform and opening up, China's higher education system reform has not made great achievements.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
